ticles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5oV3JYa2NiNHR4RDczZTZxanJJenl2VWIzYk1pUmxFTV85dEFkdzRUMXNTZklvaEJfZGotVEg5T0VZS0RtWUl1TTJ1SHFycVJlal96R2dMeExFZDVlb2o1VzdSdXN4cGw3VW54Vg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-24","zh":""},{"title":"Samhällsbyggnadsbolaget i Norden AB (publ) Files Info Doc For D-Share Buy-Back and Redemption","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Samhällsbyggnadsbolaget i Norden AB (publ) 文件 D 股回購與贖回資訊文件"},{"title":"Ex-Villawood director wants AFP doc share ruling iced","src":"Lawyerly","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQbkluazVqTkJpWUhkLURsdGFkVjN6WWtySnNIaDctVGtaUFBfbzM5QTg5MmpEQlIzX2lZWmRabHo5WjlkQTg5RVNmNndZS0JNaHdUdmk0Mm5kbHdlTXE0SDcyeWUybGlTX1VtY3Q5cmphQUhLcHJmRzh4OHJIZnNocXNJRHg2U0hlTVE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"前維拉伍德董事希望法新社文件分享裁決被凍結"},{"title":"Healthpeak Properties, Inc. (DOC) Stock Forecasts","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPb0pIOUF0eXhEWlotd1Y4T1Utb25QYWJTZFJJUWxab0ZHOFl0cXpxZjNHSktCRkY1M2dJeHlFSENLVkNaMFJuc0FLdTM1aUt6ckdOZ2RWZWRtTV8zTXZMU09yeEZ2bWRnUUVDNWR6VF9IX3NpM01NZnZVSGUxamE1NHlOdHdLbEpfRnNFcA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"Healthpeak Properties, Inc. (DOC) 股票預測"}],"order_news":[],"themes":[],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-03","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/765880/000162828026005044/peak-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Healthpeak Properties, Inc. is a Standard & Poor's (\"S&P\") 500 company that owns, operates, and develops high-quality real estate focused on healthcare discovery and delivery in the United States (\"U.S.\"). Our company was originally founded in 1985. We are organized as an umbrella partnership REIT (\"UPREIT\"). We hold substantially all of our assets and conduct our operations through our operating subsidiary, Healthpeak OP, a consolidated subsidiary of which we are the managing member. We are a Maryland corporation and qualify as a self-administered REIT. We are headquartered in Denver, Colorado, with additional corporate offices in California, Tennessee, Wisconsin, and Massachusetts and property management offices in several locations throughout the U.S.","zh":"Healthpeak Properties, Inc. 是一家標準普爾（「S&P」）500 強公司，在美國（「美國」）擁有、經營和開發專注於醫療保健發現和服務的優質房地產。我們公司最初成立於 1985 年。我們的組織形式是傘式合夥房地產投資信託基金（「UPREIT」）。我們幾乎持有我們所有的資產，並透過我們的營運子公司 Healthpeak OP 開展業務，Healthpeak OP 是一家合併子公司，我們是該子公司的管理成員。我們是一家馬裡蘭州公司，有資格成為自我管理的房地產投資信託基金。我們的總部位於科羅拉多州丹佛市，在加州、田納西州、威斯康辛州和麻薩諸塞州設有公司辦事處，並在美國多個地點設有物業管理辦事處。"},{"en":"We have a diversified portfolio of high-quality healthcare properties across three core asset classes of outpatient medical, lab, and senior housing real estate. Under the outpatient medical and lab segments, we own, operate, and develop outpatient medical buildings, hospitals, and lab buildings. Under the senior housing segment, our properties are operated through RIDEA structures. We have other non-reportable segments that are comprised primarily of: (i) loans receivable, (ii) a preferred equity investment, and (iii) three other properties. These non-reportable segments have been presented on a combined basis herein.","zh":"我們擁有多元化的優質醫療保健物業組合，涵蓋門診醫療、實驗室和老年住房房地產三個核心資產類別。在門診醫療和實驗室部門，我們擁有、營運和開發門診醫療建築、醫院和實驗室建築。在老年住房領域，我們的房產透過 RIDEA 結構運作。我們還有其他非報告分部，主要包括：(i) 應收貸款，(ii) 優先股權投資，以及 (iii) 其他三項財產。這些非報告分部已在本文中合併列報。"},{"en":"On March 1, 2024 (the \"Closing Date\"), we completed our merger with Physicians Realty Trust (the \"Merger\"). Subsequent to the Closing Date, the \"Combined Company\" means Healthpeak and its subsidiaries. As a result of the Merger, we acquired 299 outpatient medical buildings. See Note 3 to the Consolidated Financial Statements for additional information.","zh":"2024 年 3 月 1 日（「截止日期」），我們完成了與 Physicians Realty Trust 的合併（「合併」）。交割日後，「合併公司」指 Healthpeak 及其子公司。合併後，我們收購了 299 棟門診醫療大樓。更多資訊請參閱合併財務報表附註 3。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our outpatient medical segment includes outpatient medical buildings and hospitals. Outpatient medical buildings typically contain physicians' offices and examination rooms, and may also include pharmacies, hospital ancillary service space, and outpatient services such as diagnostic centers, rehabilitation clinics, and day-surgery operating rooms. While these facilities have certain similarities to commercial office buildings, they require additional plumbing, electrical, and mechanical systems to accommodate multiple exam rooms that may require sinks in every room and specialized equipment such as x-ray machines and MRIs. Outpatient medical buildings are often built to accommodate higher structural loads for such specialized equipment and may contain vaults or other unique construction. Our outpatient medical buildings are typically multi-tenant properties leased to healthcare providers","zh":"我們的門診醫療部門包括門診醫療大樓和醫院。門診醫療建築通常包含醫生辦公室和檢查室，也可能包括藥房、醫院輔助服務空間以及診斷中心、復健診所和日間手術室等門診服務。雖然這些設施與商業辦公大樓有某些相似之處，但它們需要額外的管道、電氣和機械系統來容納多個檢查室，這些檢查室可能需要每個房間都有水槽以及 X 光機和 MRI 等專用設備。門診醫療建築通常是為了容納此類專用設備的更高結構荷載而建造的，並且可能包含拱頂或其他獨特的結構。我們的門診醫療大樓通常是出租給醫療保健提供者的多租戶物業"},{"en":"The following table provides information about our most significant outpatient medical tenant concentration for the year ended December 31, 2025:","zh":"下表提供了截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度我們最重要的門診醫療租戶集中度的資訊："}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Investing in real estate serving the healthcare industry is highly competitive. We face competition from other REITs, investment companies, pension funds, private equity investors, sovereign funds, healthcare operators, lenders, developers, and other institutional investors, some of whom may have greater flexibility (e.g., non-REIT competitors), greater resources, and lower costs of capital than we do. Increased competition and resulting capitalization rate compression, as well as the impacts of elevated interest rates, make it more challenging for us to identify and successfully capitalize on opportunities that meet our objectives. Our ability to compete may also be impacted by global, national, and local economic trends, availability of investment alternatives, availability and cost of capital, construction and renovation costs, existing laws and regulations, new legislation, and popul","zh":"投資服務於醫療保健行業的房地產競爭非常激烈。我們面臨其他房地產投資信託基金、投資公司、退休基金、私募股權投資者、主權基金、醫療保健營運商、貸款人、開發商和其他機構投資者的競爭，其中一些投資者可能比我們擁有更大的靈活性（例如非房地產投資信託競爭對手）、更多的資源和更低的資本成本。競爭的加劇和由此導致的資本化率壓縮，以及利率上升的影響，使我們更難識別並成功利用實現我們目標的機會。我們的競爭能力也可能受到全球、國家和地方經濟趨勢、投資選擇的可用性、資本的可用性和成本、建設和改造成本、現有法律和法規、新立法以及人民的影響。"},{"en":"Income from our investments depends on our tenants' and operators' ability to compete with other companies on multiple levels, including: (i) the quality of care provided, (ii) reputation, (iii) success of product or drug development, (iv) price, (v) the range of services offered, (vi) the physical appearance of a property, (vii) alternatives for healthcare delivery, (viii) the supply of competing properties, (ix) physicians, (x) staff, (xi) referral sources, (xii) location, (xiii) the size and demographics of the population in surrounding areas, and (xiv) the financial condition of our tenants and operators. For a discussion of the risks associated with competitive conditions affecting our business, see \"Item 1A, Risk Factors\" in this report.","zh":"我們的投資收入取決於我們的租戶和運營商在多個層面與其他公司競爭的能力，包括：（i）提供的護理質量，（ii）聲譽，（iii）產品或藥物開發的成功，（iv）價格，（v）提供的服務範圍，（vi）財產的外觀，（vii）醫療保健服務的替代方案，（viii）競爭性財產的供應，（7xiiixiiixiiixii），週邊地區的人口規模和人口統計數據，以及 (xiv) 我們的租戶和經營者的財務狀況。有關影響我們業務的競爭條件相關風險的討論，請參閱本報告中的「第 1A 項，風險因素」。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Outpatient Medical","val":1273505000,"zh":"門診醫療"},{"name":"Lab","val":860020000,"zh":"實驗室"},{"name":"Senior Housing","val":603989000,"zh":"老年人住房"}],"total":2822512000}},"peers":["SBRA","LTC","STAG","DEA","WPC"]}}